{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-3f3b49cb-6cec-4b33-99d8-239cc2601d84","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a6d08b7e3c60426d","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/h5/l8qslbp55w5621qf9ngsh5jc0000gn/T/epic-RHAISTRAT-9015-xgjy54om/artifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9015-decomposition.md","content":"# Decomposition Summary — RHAISTRAT-9015: Experiment comparison for training and pipeline runs\n\nStrategy status: Refinement Done. Strategy priority: Major. No Staff Engineer Input\nsection is present, so the strategy's own requirement tables are authoritative.\n\n## Triage\n\nNot below-threshold: the strategy spans three affected components (Dashboard,\nModel Registry, Data Science Pipelines) owned by at least two teams, and it\ncontains multiple distinct work streams (Dashboard UI implementation, Model\nRegistry backend implementation, and documentation authoring). Not docs-only:\ncode changes are required. Full decomposition follows.\n\n## Epic List\n\n| ID | Title | Type | Team | Priority |\n|----|-------|------|------|----------|\n| RHAISTRAT-9015-E001 | Run comparison view for training and pipeline runs in the Dashboard | Implementation | RHOAI Dashboard | P0 |\n| RHAISTRAT-9015-E002 | Record the producing run on registered model versions | Implementation | Model Registry | P1 |\n| RHAISTRAT-9015-E003 | Open run comparison from the Model Registry view in the Dashboard | Implementation | RHOAI Dashboard | P1 |\n| RHAISTRAT-9015-E004 | Document the run comparison workflow from the runs list and the registry | Implementation (docs-authoring) | RHOAI Docs | P1 |\n\n## Dependency DAG\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    E001[RHAISTRAT-9015-E001 Run comparison view] --> E003[RHAISTRAT-9015-E003 Registry entry point]\n    E002[RHAISTRAT-9015-E002 Run-of-origin linkage] --> E003\n    E001 --> E004[RHAISTRAT-9015-E004 Documentation]\n    E002 --> E004\n    E003 --> E004\n```\n\nE001 and E002 are parallel ro