{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b3d266ca363c8694","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9015-E003\n3\ttitle: Open run comparison from the Model Registry view in the Dashboard\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9015\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9015-E001\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-9015-E002\n12\tai_signals:\n13\t  change_specificity: 0\n14\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n15\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n16\t  existing_foundation: 1\n17\t  open_questions: 1\n18\t  external_dependency: 1\n19\t  human_process_gates: 1\n20\t  repo_access: 1\n21\t  architecture_claims: 1\n22\timplementation_type: null\n23\tinvestigation_signals: null\n24\tai_implementability: High\n25\tai_implementability_score: 7\n26\tjira_key: null\n27\tbranch: null\n28\tgated_by: null\n29\tgate_failure_impact: null\n30\t---\n31\t# Open run comparison from the Model Registry view in the Dashboard\n32\t\n33\t## Description\n34\t\n35\tThis epic delivers the Model Registry entry point to the run comparison\n36\tcapability: from a registered model version viewed in the Dashboard's Model\n37\tRegistry section, a user can open a comparison that includes the run that\n38\tproduced that model version. Model promotion decisions then start from the\n39\tregistry with side-by-side visibility into what changed between candidate\n40\truns, instead of requiring users to go find the runs in the runs list first.\n41\t\n42\t## Description of Dependencies\n43\t\n44\tThis epic consumes two capabilities delivered elsewhere in the strategy and\n45\tdoes not re-implement either: the run comparison view (parameters and metrics\n46\tside by side, with diff highlighting) and the producing-run linkage recorded\n47\ton registered model versions and exposed through the Model Registry REST API.\n48\tBoth must be available before this epic's work can complete.\n49\t\n50\t## Scope\n51\t\n52\t- In the Dashboard's Model Registry view, a model version that carries a\n53\t  producing-run reference offers an action to open a comparison including that\n54\t  run.\n55\t- The action resolves the producing-run identity through the Model Registry\n56\t  and navigates to the existing run comparison view with that run loaded,\n57\t  letting the user add further runs to the comparison.\n58\t- The entry point is hidden or disabled for model versions that carry no\n59\t  producing-run reference.\n60\t\n61\t## Acceptance Criteria\n62\t\n63\t- From a registered model version in the Dashboard's Model Registry view that\n64\t  has a recorded producing run, a user can open a comparison that includes\n65\t  that run, rendered by the existing comparison view.\n66\t- The user can add one or more further runs to the comparison opened this way,\n67\t  for both training runs and pipeline runs.\n68\t- Model versions without a producing-run reference show no broken entry point\n69\t  (the action is absent or visibly disabled with a clear reason).\n70\t\n71\t## HLR Traceability\n72\t\n73\t- HLR-2 (P1): registered model versions link back to the run that produced\n74\t  them, so a comparison can be opened from the Model Registry — the\n75\t  Dashboard-side entry point over the registry linkage.\n76\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ae73c8568e3e2785","agent_id":"afca3fc790f0e8d8a","session_id":"e17dd9cb-088d-45af-9a10-58f6765a919b","uuid":"0eaf6d67-8012-499e-b5ed-5af833475972","timestamp":"2026-10-26T21:23:17.723Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b3d266ca363c8694","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
