{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-85739929b2f19a78","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9015-E001\n3\ttitle: Run comparison view for training and pipeline runs in the Dashboard\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9015\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tai_signals:\n11\t  change_specificity: 0\n12\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n13\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n14\t  existing_foundation: 1\n15\t  open_questions: 1\n16\t  external_dependency: 1\n17\t  human_process_gates: 1\n18\t  repo_access: 1\n19\t  architecture_claims: 1\n20\timplementation_type: null\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 7\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# Run comparison view for training and pipeline runs in the Dashboard\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tThis epic delivers the run comparison capability in the Dashboard: users can\n34\tselect two or more training or pipeline runs and view their parameters and\n35\tmetrics side by side, including a diff presentation that highlights which\n36\tparameters and metrics changed between two selected runs. Today parameters and\n37\tmetrics live only on per-run pages, forcing data scientists to compare runs in\n38\texported spreadsheets; this epic brings that comparison in-platform.\n39\t\n40\t## Scope\n41\t\n42\t- Multi-select of two or more runs (training runs and Data Science Pipelines\n43\t  runs) from the runs list in the Dashboard.\n44\t- A side-by-side comparison view of the selected runs' parameters and metrics.\n45\t- A diff presentation mode over the same comparison data that highlights which\n46\t  parameters and metrics differ between two selected runs.\n47\t- Correct rendering of runs with differing parameter/metric sets (values\n48\t  present on one run and absent on another).\n49\t- Comparison stays within a single project and cluster, consistent with the\n50\t  strategy's out-of-scope statement (no cross-project or cross-cluster\n51\t  comparison).\n52\t\n53\t## Acceptance Criteria\n54\t\n55\t- A user can select two or more runs from the runs list and open a comparison\n56\t  showing each run's parameters and metrics side by side.\n57\t- Given two selected runs, the comparison highlights which parameters and\n58\t  metrics changed between them.\n59\t- The comparison correctly renders parameters and metrics for Data Science\n60\t  Pipelines runs as well as training runs (validation of the passive Data\n61\t  Science Pipelines component — its run data is consumed as-is through\n62\t  existing interfaces, with no pipelines-side changes).\n63\t- The comparison handles runs whose parameter/metric sets differ without\n64\t  errors or silent omission.\n65\t- Comparison is offered only for runs within the same project and cluster.\n66\t\n67\t## HLR Traceability\n68\t\n69\t- HLR-1 (P0): select two or more runs and view parameters and metrics side by\n70\t  side in the Dashboard.\n71\t- HLR-3 (P1, consolidated with HLR-1): run \"diff\" view highlighting which\n72\t  parameters and metrics changed between two selected runs — a presentation\n73\t  mode of the same comparison surface, covered by this epic at the higher\n74\t  priority rather than split into a separate epic.\n75\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-857d21ecca0f3048","agent_id":"a44c080f0f8d2aad2","session_id":"e17dd9cb-088d-45af-9a10-58f6765a919b","uuid":"ff4f0e4c-96ad-43df-b0f7-c33875a2019e","timestamp":"2026-10-26T21:25:27.983Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-85739929b2f19a78","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
